.TH "ARC-CONVERT" "1" "2026-09-27" "arc-cli" "Arc Manual"
.SH "NAME"
arc\-convert \- convert an archive or compressed stream
.SH "SYNOPSIS"
arc convert SOURCE [DESTINATION] [FORMAT\-SELECTOR] [OPTIONS]
.PP
arccv ...
.PP
arc\-convert ...
.PP
arcconvert ...
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
Transform one logical archive representation into another through Arc's normalized content detection, member selection, safety validation, destination creation, integrity verification, and publication rules. SOURCE is preserved unless \-\-replace\-source is explicit.
